WEBVTT

00:12:28.978 --> 00:12:30.346
So many moments.

00:12:30.380 --> 00:12:31.514
Look ...

00:12:32.348 --> 00:12:37.186
Standing here and trying to describe
these parts of my life is hard.

00:12:38.121 --> 00:12:40.890
I experience these things
on a daily basis,

00:12:40.923 --> 00:12:43.326
and yet I can't seem
to find the right words

00:12:43.359 --> 00:12:45.695
to try and describe
to all of you what it's like.

00:12:46.829 --> 00:12:50.566
The words I do seem to find
don't fully depict the gravity

00:12:50.600 --> 00:12:52.368
of these situations.

00:12:52.702 --> 00:12:54.570
What it feels like to be in them.

00:12:54.604 --> 00:12:59.509
Situations that I got one singular
day of education for.